{
    "file_name": "AFP_ENG_20061221.0221.tml",
    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_20061221.0221\n\nTHE HAGUE, Dec 21 , 2006, 2006\n\nDutch annual growth comes to 2.7 percent in third quarter\n\n\n\n\nThe Dutch economy grew at an annual rate of 2.7 percent in the third quarter compared with output in the same period last year and gained 0.7 percent from the second quarter, the central statistics office said Thursday.\n\nThe office said growth in exports and household spending was slightly below that of the previous six months while investment was stronger.\n\nThe pace of Dutch growth has practically doubled in the course of a year, the agency added.",
